    {
      "id": "tide-sig-11",
      "name": "Kasane signature",
      "shortName": "Event Copy Engine",
      "summary": "A sprawling event-chain deck that ramps energy into copy-doubling events to close with plays-matter erosion and token floods, differentiated from its facet siblings by a deep void reclaim loop and mass hand-reset suite that sustains multi-chain turns rather than simply outputting raw energy.",
      "description": "Tide-sig-11 is built around a core trio of event-copying payoffs — Echo Architect (copy every event you play, at the cost of 1● extra each), Cascade of Reflections (copy all events for a turn), and Cascading Detonation (copy the next event twice, then reclaim for 5●) — backed by abundant energy ramp through Arc Gate Opening (gain 4●), Flash of Power (gain 5●), Data Pulse (gain 2● plus draw), Starcatcher (gain 1● per event), and Pulse of Sacrifice (discard hand for 3●). The plays-matter payoffs that consume the resulting chains are Call of the Lost (materialize a 1✦ ember figment per card played, with reclaim) and Hatching Ground (chosen player erodes X for each card played), while Echoes of the Journey refuels by drawing an ephemeral card for each card already played that turn. A robust void reclaim layer — Path to Redemption (all void cards gain reclaim), From the Barrow (all void events gain reclaim, self-reclaims on discard), Archive of the Forgotten, and Cascading Detonation's own reclaim — keeps the copying engine alive across multiple turns. Where the nearest sibling facets (Flash of Power and Call of the Lost facets) focus more narrowly on energy generation and copying as a burst damage tool, this tide integrates mass hand-reset events (Reunion, Starfall Communion) and deep discard cycling (Fragments of Vision, Iconoclast, Key Sifter) to sustain chain turns rather than merely set up a single high-output play.",
      "role": "signature",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"01d53e49-7833-4122-a970-b72c73ad2c28","name":"Crimson Pilgrimage","copies":2},
        {"id":"08fe3190-f559-4152-941d-33ec4180f509","name":"Data Pulse","copies":2},
        {"id":"1434440c-c86f-4b7d-83e7-3bd1f7dde63e","name":"Pulse of Sacrifice","copies":2},
