    {
      "id": "tide-fac-11",
      "name": "Lean: Shadowbinder",
      "shortName": "Abandon for Energy",
      "summary": "This tide converts low-cost characters into energy and spark growth through active abandonment, distinguishing itself from its nearest siblings by running a dense cluster of abandon-for-● effects that fuel escalating payoffs, rather than primarily rewarding dissolution triggers or cheap character loops.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-11 is a character-dense deck (40 of 45 copies are characters) built around voluntarily abandoning allies to generate energy (●) and grow ✦ values. Multiple double-copy cards form the engine's core: Exiles of the Last Light abandons a character to gain 1●, Harvester of Despair gains +1✦ per abandonment, and Skull Weaver gains 1⍟ whenever any ally leaves play — all creating immediate returns from sacrificing your own board. Supporting 1x pieces reinforce the same axis: Shadowbinder, Infernal Ascendant, and Nightmare Manifest each abandon a character to produce energy, while Herald of the Last Light both grows on abandonment and can spend that energy to draw cards. The dramatic payoff is Stolen Genesis, which demands an abandoned character as its cost in order to materialize a higher-cost character from your deck, converting small fuel into large threats. Compared to sibling tide-fac-24, which centers dissolution triggers — characters that fire passively when allies are dissolved by combat — this tide is active and deliberate, choosing when to sacrifice rather than reacting to battle outcomes. Compared to sibling tide-fac-25, which emphasizes cheap character recurrence (Veil of the Wastes looping back on low-cost plays, Paradox Enforcer from the void), tide-fac-11 spends its characters as a resource to accelerate energy production and spike ✦, playing as a sacrifice-ramp deck that converts board presence into momentum.",
      "role": "facet",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"16d2e85d-f940-43dd-9867-784b3a5ec5d7","name":"Stargazer Adrift","copies":2},
        {"id":"1d92e103-8415-433d-97d6-ac8a83660b34","name":"Searcher in the Mists","copies":2},
