    {
      "id": "tide-fac-14",
      "name": "Lean: Kindred Sparks",
      "shortName": "Abandon Refuel",
      "summary": "An abandon-centric tide that converts its own characters' dissolution into simultaneous energy, card draw, and interrupt-speed removal, distinguishing itself from its closest sibling by balancing all three payoff types rather than doubling down on energy generation alone.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-14 is an almost entirely character-based tide (39 of 45 copies) built around a tight loop: sacrifice your own characters to gain energy, refill your hand, and threaten fast removal. The doubled Exiles of the Last Light anchor the abandon engine, each providing 1● when another character is sacrificed, while Scuttled Fortune draws a card for every ally that dissolved this turn and Soulreaver and Deathwalker generate additional draws whenever survivors or non-figment allies leave play. Dissolution also unlocks interrupt-speed threats — Together Against the Tide dissolves a low-cost enemy the same turn you abandon a character, and Ferryman's Tithe dissolves any enemy as a fast interrupt via its Offering keyword. The tide sustains its board through Shadowcaller (spawning a survivor figment each time an ally is dissolved), Defiant Holdout (materializing figments on its own dissolution proportional to its spark), and Duskwall Delver (re-entering from the void for 1● whenever any ally is dissolved). Its closest sibling, Stargazer Adrift, shares the same foundation of abandon triggers and survivor synergies but leans harder into energy generation with doubled copies of Volcanic Channeler; this tide trades that energy concentration for broader payoff coverage — card draw engines, a void-recurrence package, and built-in interrupt removal — making it the more versatile but slightly less explosive version of the archetype.",
      "role": "facet",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"37d9165f-2b3a-44a2-848b-401cf4466a7c","name":"Silent Avenger","copies":2},
        {"id":"b56b3411-50c7-4cc9-90e0-d4ffcaec73c6","name":"Exiles of the Last Light","copies":2},
