    {
      "id": "tide-fac-18",
      "name": "Lean: Unleashed Destruction",
      "shortName": "Event Copy Ramp",
      "summary": "A ramp-into-event-copying tide that builds energy quickly and then multiplies key events through The Ringleader and copy spells, distinguished from its closest sibling (Scorched Reckoning) by focusing on doubling individual powerful events rather than counting total cards played in a turn.",
      "description": "Tide-fac-18 is built around two interlocking halves: an energy ramp package and a suite of event-copying multipliers. The ramp side leans on Data Pulse (two copies, gain 2● and draw), Arc Gate Opening, Canopy of Stars, and Flash of Power to generate the energy needed to chain plays in a single turn. The copying payoffs then amplify whatever that energy unleashes — The Ringleader (two copies) creates a free ephemeral copy of the next event played after it materializes, Echo Architect copies every event at the cost of 1● extra per play, and finishers like Cascade of Reflections and Cascading Detonation (which copies the next event twice and reclaims 5●) reward committing large amounts of energy to a single decisive turn. A removal suite anchored by Unleashed Destruction, Scorched Reckoning, Fell the Mighty, and the void-scaling Weight of Memory keeps the board clear while void-reclaim tools (Weblight Waif, Archive of the Forgotten, Somber Flockmaster, From the Barrow) let spent events cycle back for additional copies. Compared to the nearest sibling Scorched Reckoning (tide-fac-10), which runs two copies each of Call of the Lost, Hatching Ground, Starcatcher, and Iconoclast to reward churning through the largest possible number of events per turn for mass figment production and erosion payoffs, this tide cares about multiplying the impact of specific events rather than maximizing raw card count — fewer \"cards played this turn\" scalers, more direct copy effects tied to The Ringleader's entry trigger and the high-ceiling copy spells.",
      "role": "facet",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"08fe3190-f559-4152-941d-33ec4180f509","name":"Data Pulse","copies":2},
        {"id":"4cec92f2-9bac-4949-a602-cd0a44618aaf","name":"The Ringleader","copies":2},
        {"id":"006e2f95-59a2-4cda-a777-e64f4aa31060","name":"Unleashed Destruction","copies":1},
