    {
      "id": "tide-fac-25",
      "name": "Lean: Shadowcaller",
      "shortName": "Erode Pressure Reclaim",
      "summary": "A cheap-survivor flood that generates constant erode pressure through character play and sacrifice, then reclaims key pieces from the void to sustain the assault — where the nearest sibling (tide-fac-31) rewards dissolves primarily with card draw and energy, this tide converts those same dissolves into board tokens and recurring threats via its void loop.",
      "description": "This tide is built around a dense curve of inexpensive survivors whose arrival and departure both deal damage: Searcher in the Mists erodes 4 on both materialization and dissolution, while Fargazer (5✦) erodes 1 each time any character is played and reclaims itself from the void for 2●, making it the tide's central pressure engine. Veil of the Wastes (2 copies) self-recurs from the void whenever a cheap character enters play, feeding the loop that keeps triggering Fargazer and Searcher. Shadowcaller converts each ally dissolution into a 1✦ survivor figment and gains reclaim when discarded or eroded, ensuring the tide never runs out of bodies, while Deathwalker draws a card on every allied survivor dissolution to maintain resources. The void deepens naturally as survivors cycle in and out, eventually enabling the Paradox Enforcer (banish 7 from void for a 7✦ Unstoppable body) and The Rising God (8-cost 7✦ Unstoppable, reclaimed by abandoning two characters) as game-ending threats. Interrupt-speed removal — Ferryman's Tithe (Offering, dissolve an enemy) and Burning Pursuit (costs 1● less per allied character) — protects the board long enough for erode to accumulate. Compared to the nearest sibling (tide-fac-31, Soulreaver), which runs double Volcanic Channeler and Soulreaver as its payoffs and rewards dissolves primarily with energy and card draw, this tide converts the same dissolve events into relentless erode damage and recurring void threats, prioritizing offensive attrition over card advantage accumulation.",
      "role": "facet",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"1d92e103-8415-433d-97d6-ac8a83660b34","name":"Searcher in the Mists","copies":2},
