    {
      "id": "tide-neu-09",
      "name": "Broad: Nightmare Manifest / Dustborn Veteran",
      "shortName": "Abandon Toolkit",
      "summary": "A broad neutral sampler that fuels an abandon-and-dissolve engine across multiple payoff axes — energy ramp, ⍟ scoring, figment token floods, card draw, and removal events — where the sibling facet tides focus that same engine on just one or two concentrated payoffs.",
      "description": "Tide-neu-09 is a character-heavy neutral tide (25 characters, 5 events, all at 1 copy) built around the abandon-and-dissolve loop as a universal fuel source. Low-cost characters generate energy when sacrificed: Nightmare Manifest produces 1● each dawn and again whenever you abandon a character; Exiles of the Last Light turns an abandon into a free 1●; Entropy Spike gains 1● or 1 maximum ● when it is dissolved. That energy flow feeds mid-range threats and payoffs: Fathomless Maw scores 1⍟ every time you abandon a character, Volcanic Channeler recovers 1● each time any ally is dissolved, Soulreaver draws a card when a non-figment ally is dissolved, and Deathwalker draws when an allied survivor specifically dissolves. The tide rounds out with figment-token payoffs (Dustborn Veteran replaces dissolved survivors with 1✦ figments; Defiant Holdout floods the board with survivor figments on its own dissolution), void-recursion tools (Duskwall Delver rebounds from the void when an ally dissolves; Veil of the Wastes returns itself whenever you materialize a cheap character), and two interrupt removal events (Ferryman's Tithe and Immolate) that can punish the opponent mid-turn. Where tide-fac-24 and tide-fac-14 each run 2x copies of their chosen payoff pieces — creating a focused, redundant version of the same engine — tide-neu-09 instead spreads one copy across every branch of the loop, giving a drafter access to the full toolkit at the cost of consistency in any single payoff line.",
      "role": "neutral",
      "cards": [
        {"id":"0458658d-7e02-4286-9249-93674d16620b","name":"Nightmare Manifest","copies":1},
        {"id":"123baf70-305a-4583-bdba-a10b5153fbeb","name":"Dustborn Veteran","copies":1},
